{
    "title": "BeSoccer - Soccer Live Score",
    "description": "<b>\u26bdFind out all the soccer results from around the world</b>\r\n\r\n<b>\u2b50With Besoccer - Resultados de Futbol you can follow all soccer matches live</b>, all the competitions, all the transfer window, all the latest news, everything and more on Besoccer.\r\n\r\n<h4>\ud83c\udfc6Get all the matches and results of the MLS, LaLiga, Premier League, Champions League and more!\ud83c\udfc6</h4>\r\n\r\n<b>We have THE BIGGEST soccer database in the world, with over 100 MILLION downloads!</b>\ud83c\udfc5\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udc40We cover more than 10,000 competitions</b>, so you can find and follow your favourite team in any competition. You will receive personalised notifications about goals, line-ups, news, transfers, live matches and much more!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49\u200bDownload besoccer now and enjoy all the soccer scores from around the world\ud83d\udc48\u200b\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca5BESOCCER THE WORLD'S BEST SOCCER RESULTS APP\r\n\r\n- You can see all today's fixtures and results\r\n- Discover the channels where your favourite matches are being played\r\n- Get the latest news on the most important players, current competitions, top teams and transfer market\r\n- Follow all the world's matches live with up-to-the-minute reviews\r\n- Get a large number of player and team statistics\r\n- Discuss matches with our large community of users\r\n- Analysis and prediction of soccer match results\r\n- Videographs and infographics with the statistics of your favourite teams and players.\r\n- We have a simple and easy to use interface, as well as an elegant and efficient design\r\n- Now you can save battery with our new \"dark mode\"\r\n \r\n\ud83d\ude80<b>GET UNIQUE BESOCCER FEATURES</b>\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0fYou can <b>customise the app according to your preferences</b>.- Receive live notifications of all your teams, players, competitions as well as goals, soccer results, standings, possible line-ups, transfer market news.\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0f<b>All results, statistics and standings</b>.- You can check all soccer results and statistics of all competitions and leagues around the world, now also for women's soccer, MLS, La Liga, Premier League, Serie A, Ligue 1, as well as Champions League, Europa League, Conference League, UEFA Nations League and more!\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0f<b>Search for all the information with our customised search engine</b>.- With our search engine you can search as many times as you want, without limits, for players, competitions and teams. Who has scored more goals, Haaland or Mbappe? Who has more titles, Messi or Cristiano? Which teams have more league titles? who will win the paris 2024 Olympic Games?\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0f<b>Check out the entire transfer market</b>.- Keep up to date with all the latest soccer transfer news, you can see all the rumours and transfers of your favourite teams and featured players. What are the latest Barcelona rumours? How is the transfer market in MLS, La Liga, Serie A and Premier League? All that in our soccer news and live scores app.\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0f<b>Follow the entire football calendar of all leagues</b>.- Check the schedule of upcoming matches, matchdays and notifications of upcoming fixtures near you. All the calendar with soccer news and players to keep you up to date with all the upcoming live matches.\r\n \r\n\ud83d\udcad<b>We love to hear your opinions!</b>\r\nWe are constantly improving our app thanks to your suggestions and feedback!\r\n \r\nIf your league or player is missing, let us know and we will add it\ud83d\udc9a\u26bd\r\n\r\nBeSoccer is also fully compatible with Wear OS.\r\n \r\nFacebook: facebook.com/besoccerlivescore/ \r\nTwitter(X): @besoccer_com\r\nInstagram: @besoccer.en\r\nEmail: soporte@besoccer.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>\u26bdFind out all the soccer results from around the world</b><br><br><b>\u2b50With Besoccer - Resultados de Futbol you can follow all soccer matches live</b>, all the competitions, all the transfer window, all the latest news, everything and more on Besoccer.<br><br><h4>\ud83c\udfc6Get all the matches and results of the MLS, LaLiga, Premier League, Champions League and more!\ud83c\udfc6</h4><br><br><b>We have THE BIGGEST soccer database in the world, with over 100 MILLION downloads!</b>\ud83c\udfc5<br><br><b>\ud83d\udc40We cover more than 10,000 competitions</b>, so you can find and follow your favourite team in any competition. You will receive personalised notifications about goals, line-ups, news, transfers, live matches and much more!<br><br>\ud83d\udc49\u200bDownload besoccer now and enjoy all the soccer scores from around the world\ud83d\udc48\u200b<br><br>\ud83d\udca5BESOCCER THE WORLD&#39;S BEST SOCCER RESULTS APP<br><br>- You can see all today&#39;s fixtures and results<br>- Discover the channels where your favourite matches are being played<br>- Get the latest news on the most important players, current competitions, top teams and transfer market<br>- Follow all the world&#39;s matches live with up-to-the-minute reviews<br>- Get a large number of player and team statistics<br>- Discuss matches with our large community of users<br>- Analysis and prediction of soccer match results<br>- Videographs and infographics with the statistics of your favourite teams and players.<br>- We have a simple and easy to use interface, as well as an elegant and efficient design<br>- Now you can save battery with our new &quot;dark mode&quot;<br> <br>\ud83d\ude80<b>GET UNIQUE BESOCCER FEATURES</b><br><br>\u2714\ufe0fYou can <b>customise the app according to your preferences</b>.- Receive live notifications of all your teams, players, competitions as well as goals, soccer results, standings, possible line-ups, transfer market news.<br><br>\u2714\ufe0f<b>All results, statistics and standings</b>.- You can check all soccer results and statistics of all competitions and leagues around the world, now also for women&#39;s soccer, MLS, La Liga, Premier League, Serie A, Ligue 1, as well as Champions League, Europa League, Conference League, UEFA Nations League and more!<br><br>\u2714\ufe0f<b>Search for all the information with our customised search engine</b>.- With our search engine you can search as many times as you want, without limits, for players, competitions and teams. Who has scored more goals, Haaland or Mbappe? Who has more titles, Messi or Cristiano? Which teams have more league titles? who will win the paris 2024 Olympic Games?<br><br>\u2714\ufe0f<b>Check out the entire transfer market</b>.- Keep up to date with all the latest soccer transfer news, you can see all the rumours and transfers of your favourite teams and featured players. What are the latest Barcelona rumours? How is the transfer market in MLS, La Liga, Serie A and Premier League? All that in our soccer news and live scores app.<br><br>\u2714\ufe0f<b>Follow the entire football calendar of all leagues</b>.- Check the schedule of upcoming matches, matchdays and notifications of upcoming fixtures near you. All the calendar with soccer news and players to keep you up to date with all the upcoming live matches.<br> <br>\ud83d\udcad<b>We love to hear your opinions!</b><br>We are constantly improving our app thanks to your suggestions and feedback!<br> <br>If your league or player is missing, let us know and we will add it\ud83d\udc9a\u26bd<br><br>BeSoccer is also fully compatible with Wear OS.<br> <br>Facebook: facebook.com/besoccerlivescore/ <br>Twitter(X): @besoccer_com<br>Instagram: @besoccer.en<br>Email: soporte@besoccer.com",
